Package: hermeswebui-service
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: __DEB_ARCH__
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Moechz <zhoucaven@163.com>
Depends: systemd, ca-certificates
Description: Hermes Agent WebUI service for TOS 7
 Web interface for the Hermes Agent: chat with full CLI parity, sessions,
 workspace browsing, profiles and first-run onboarding. Python runtime and
 agent components are provisioned at first service start from a pinned,
 SHA-256-verified manifest (D-007/D-010).
